detailed_feedback: "The candidate shows promise in their technical foundation, particularly with Python programming and version control systems. Their academic research background and infrastructure experience at Deutsche Börse demonstrate capability with complex technical systems.\n\nHowever, there are significant gaps between the candidate's current experience level and the role requirements. With only 2 years of professional experience versus the required 7+, and no demonstrated experience with FastAPI or web framework development, the candidate does not meet the core requirements for this senior position.\n\nWhile the candidate maintains an active GitHub presence, their projects primarily focus on academic and algorithmic implementations rather than web development or framework contributions. The lack of experience with the FastAPI ecosystem (including Starlette and Pydantic) represents a critical gap for this specific role."
hiring_manager_notes: "While the candidate shows technical potential, they are not currently suited for this senior role. The 5+ year experience gap and lack of specific web framework development experience are significant concerns. Consider keeping their profile for more junior backend development positions that may open in the future.\n\nThe candidate would need several years of focused web framework development experience before being ready for a senior role of this nature. Their current skill set would be better aligned with entry to mid-level backend development positions, particularly those focused on general Python development or infrastructure."